---
args: { docket: BillingDocket, book: ObligationBook | null }
returns: MilestonePacket
---
Bind prior to the supplied obligation book or an empty book at revision zero with empty clocks, acceptance, earnedSlices, consumption and historicalSourceVersions. Bind clocks = buildContractClocks(docket, prior.clocks). Preserve every earned slice's original effective rate schedule.

Bind deliveries = mapDeliveryClaims(docket.agreementSources, clocks). Keep project labels as aliases of contract milestone identities, never as replacement identities. Drafts shared for feedback remain distinct from contractual handovers. Initialize acceptance: AcceptanceDecision[] = []; for each milestone and phase in clocks call adjudicateAcceptance(clock, deliveries, docket.authorityRecords, docket.agreementSources), collecting each actual decision in acceptance. An unauthorized acknowledgment can remain useful evidence while a confirmation request stays open.

Bind slices = computeUnconsumedEntitlement(clocks, acceptance, prior, docket.agreementSources). Allocate only the accepted phase or authorized partial fraction. Preserve unresolved triggers, caps, conversion bases and timing prerequisites as holds. Bind packetDraft = bindCustomerPacket(docket, slices, acceptance, prior). Use the child's actual customer lines, approval bindings, missing confirmations and packet identity; a packet is ready only when every proposed amount is supported and its exact approval bindings are current.

Bind nextBook: ObligationBook = { revision: advance only when a clock edition, acceptance decision, earned slice or source version changed; otherwise preserve prior.revision, clocks: merge by milestone/agreement/effective interval while retaining superseded editions, acceptance: append decisions by milestone and phase while retaining prior evidence, earnedSlices: append or supersede only the exact affected milestone/phase schedule, consumption: prior.consumption unchanged because preparation supplies no invoice or void receipt, historicalSourceVersions: prior versions plus the exact source editions used }. Bind packet: MilestonePacket = { packetId: packetDraft.packetId, book: nextBook, customerLines: packetDraft.customerLines, proposedSlices: packetDraft.proposedSlices, approvalBindings: packetDraft.approvalBindings, missingConfirmations: packetDraft.missingConfirmations plus every held slice's specific unresolved trigger/cap/rate condition, readyForRelease: packetDraft.readyForRelease and no proposed slice has an unsupported amount or stale approval binding }. Return packet. It does not create an invoice.
